---
import './AboutIntro.css';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <p class="eyebrow about__eyebrow" data-reveal>About</p>
  <h2 class="visually-hidden">About me</h2>
  <p class="about__statement" data-word-scrub>
    I care about the gap between how a system works and how a person feels using
    it. Most of my work is about closing that gap through better structure,
    clearer interfaces, and products that respect the people they serve.
  </p>

  <div class="about__grid">
    <div class="about-card" data-reveal>
      <h3 class="about-card__title">Systems thinking</h3>
      <p class="about-card__text">
        I approach problems from the data, the flow, and the user outward - not
        from the screen inward.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.1">
      <h3 class="about-card__title">Design + build</h3>
      <p class="about-card__text">
        I like to take an idea from rough concept through interface to shipped,
        working product.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.2">
      <h3 class="about-card__title">Always learning</h3>
      <p class="about-card__text">
        Currently exploring how modern web tooling and thoughtful motion can
        feel fast and natural.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
